<title>USA: Daw Technologies to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Daw Technologies to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daw Technologies Inc said on Monday its board of directors has authorized the repurchase of up to 10 percent of its common stock.</p>
<p>Repurchases will be made from time to time in the open market or through privately negotiated transactions, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Timing of the program and the amount of Daw stock repurchased will be dictated by overall financial and market conditions, the company said.</p>
<p>Repurchased shares will be used to meet Daw's requirements for its benefit plans.</p>
</text>
